            "type": "completion",
            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 1–10</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "bodyHtml": "<p>Complete the notes below. Write <strong>ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p><div><div class=\"notes-title\"><strong>Holiday Job</strong></div><ul><li>Location {{1}} Island</li><li>Start date {{2}}</li></ul><p class=\"sub-head\">Available jobs</p><p class=\"sub-head\"><strong>Vacancy 1: Calypso Bistro</strong></p><ul><li>working as a {{3}}</li><li>no experience needed</li></ul><p class=\"sub-head\"><strong>Vacancy 2: Guest Liaison</strong></p><ul><li>must be able to {{4}}</li></ul><p class=\"sub-head\"><strong>Vacancy 3: Activities staff</strong></p><ul><li>help with games and water sports</li><li>need experience with {{5}}</li></ul><p class=\"sub-head\"><strong>Vacancy 4: In reception</strong></p><ul><li>as a porter</li><li>must be able to {{6}}</li></ul><p class=\"sub-head\">Benefits</p><p class=\"sub-head\">For all jobs,</p><ul><li>there is free {{7}}</li><li>{{8}} are provided</li></ul><p class=\"sub-head\">Interview</p><ul><li>to be held on {{9}} at 2pm</li><li>bring a CV and a {{10}}</li></ul></div>",
            "maxWords": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "number": 2,
        "title": "Part 2",
        "instructionsHtml": "<p>Listen and answer questions 11–20.</p>",
        "groups": [
          {
            "id": "part-2-group-1",
            "type": "mcq",
            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 11–15</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "questions": [
              {
                "number": 11,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;The walk is organised specifically for",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "extremely fit people."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "parents with their children."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "tourists unfamiliar with the local area."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 12,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;The maximum number of people on the walk will be",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "220."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "250."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "280."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 13,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;The organisers will stop walkers taking part if they",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "arrive without a waterproof coat."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "are causing a lot of trouble."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "are unable to answer basic safety questions."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 14,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;The walk was cancelled two years previously because of",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "illness in the organising team."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "very stormy weather."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "problems getting people to help."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 15,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;Badges can be obtained",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "only when they have been ordered before the walk."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "immediately people have completed the whole walk."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "one week after the walk has finished."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
