            "selectCount": 1,
            "bodyHtml": "<p>Complete the notes below. Write <strong>ONE WORD ONLY</strong> for each answer.</p><div><div class=\"notes-title\"><strong>Public Monument Assignment</strong></div><p class=\"sub-head\">Section one</p><p>First, identify the monument and justify your choice</p><ul><li>Comment on the {{31}} of the monument</li></ul><p class=\"sub-head\">Add information about its:</p><ul><li>geographical location</li><li>{{32}} significance</li><li>historical context</li></ul><p>Illustrate assignment with:</p><ul><li>{{33}}</li><li>photos (with captions)</li></ul><p>End with: record of architect's achievements</p><p class=\"sub-head\">Section two: Design and construction</p><p>Include information about</p><ul><li>The {{34}} of any particular style on the design</li><li>The {{35}} used in construction</li><li>Specialist {{36}} required</li></ul><p class=\"sub-head\">Section three: Assessment of design</p><p>Content should include: personal assessment, results of your survey</p><p>Use personal assessment and survey to consider:</p><ul><li>the {{37}} for building the monument</li><li>the monument's {{38}} effect on members of the public</li><li>how well the monument suits its {{39}}</li></ul><p class=\"sub-head\">Remember!</p><ul><li>Credit given for good {{40}}</li></ul></div>",
